Package: com.m3ga.m3gasignalbars
Name: M3gaSignalBars
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Cosmetic full-strength cellular signal bars for classic iOS 6.
 Shows five full native signal bars when enabled and restores the real modem
 signal display when disabled. It does not improve reception or create cellular
 service. Includes an optional Settings switch, Instructions, and creator info.
Maintainer: M3gaIOS6p0w3r
Author: M3gaIOS6p0w3r
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 6.0)
